{"meta":{"id":"sync","category":"it/syntax/typescript/network","title":"동기 처리 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"위에서 아래로 끝날 때까지 기다리는 실행 — 브라우저 통신은 항상 비동기","tags":["typescript","f-network","f-async"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">동기 처리 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 위에서 아래로 끝날 때까지 기다리는 실행 — 브라우저 통신은 항상 비동기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">동기 처리</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">코드가 <strong>위에서 아래로 한 줄씩</strong> 끝날 때까지 기다리며 실행된다. 앞 작업이 오래 걸리면 그동안 화면(이벤트 루프)이 멈춘다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function calc() {\r\n  const a = heavyWork();   // 끝날 때까지 다음 줄로 가지 않음\r\n  const b = a * 2;\r\n  return b;\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst data = JSON.parse(text);      // 동기\r\nconst raw = fs.readFileSync(&quot;a.txt&quot;, &quot;utf-8&quot;);  // Node.js 동기 파일 읽기</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">통신은 비동기</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">브라우저 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>fetch</code> 는 항상 비동기 (Promise 반환) — 동기 통신 방식은 없음</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>XMLHttpRequest</code> 의 동기 모드는 화면을 멈추므로 사용 중단(deprecated)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">결과 순서가 필요하면 async / await 로 동기처럼 순서대로 작성한다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 통신 › async / await, 통신 › Promise</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network/sync","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network"}],"hasImage":false}